stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Accepted: multishot accept
  Accepted --> ProxyHeader: listener has proxyProtocol=1
  Accepted --> Handshake: secure listener
  Accepted --> Sniff: plain listener
  ProxyHeader --> Handshake: header valid (else close)
  ProxyHeader --> Sniff
  Handshake --> ALPN: rustls (TLS 1.2 / 1.3, SNI, optional client cert)
  ALPN --> H1: http/1.1
  ALPN --> H2: h2
  Sniff --> H2: 24-byte h2c preface
  Sniff --> H1: anything else
  H1 --> H1: keep-alive ≤ maxKeepAliveReq
  H2 --> H2: streams multiplexed on one task
  H1 --> Closed: Connection close · timeout · error
  H2 --> Closed: GOAWAY drain · timeout
  Closed --> [*]
